<title>USA: Digital Microwave plans secondary offer.</title>
<headline>Digital Microwave plans secondary offer.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Microwave Corp said it will file a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the proposed public offering of $2.2 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>It said it anticipates all the shares offered will be sold by the company. Proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, including working capital, development and marketing of new products and for possible future acquisitions.</p>
</text>
